# tools/vcpkg was recorded as a gitlink with no .gitmodules entry and nothing in
# the build referencing it, which made every recursive clone (and any CI
# checkout asking for submodules) fail on "No url found for submodule path".
# Untracked now; keep a stray local checkout out of git's way.
